OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment probe into housing     
OL,4,Ascheme 'exploitation'                  
OL,6,FThe government has announced an        
OL,7,Findependent inquiry into allegations   
OL,8,Frogue landlords in Birmingham are      
OL,9,Fmaking huge profits by exploiting a    
OL,10,Fhousing scheme.                        
OL,12,FBBC Panorama reported last month that  
OL,13,Fsome companies in the city were taking 
OL,14,Fadvantage of the Supported Exempt      
OL,15,FAccommodation (SEA) system, intended to
OL,16,Fprovide housing along with care and    
OL,17,Fsupport for vulnerable people.         
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
