OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment probe into housing     
OL,4,Ascheme 'exploitation'                  
OL,6,FThere have been claims of fraud, crime,
OL,7,Fpoor housing and firms receiving       
OL,8,Fhousing benefits on behalf of residents
OL,9,Fbut not giving them the support they   
OL,10,Fare meant to.                          
OL,12,FA government spokesperson said an      
OL,13,Feight-week investigation would begin   
OL,14,Fimmediately, with initial findings and 
OL,15,Frecommendations reported to ministers  
OL,16,Fin the new year.                       
